I would start fighting like a real Doppleganger.  You already have the
The Eye of the Aethiopica, which is the #1 Doppleganger item.  The Eye
lets you have magic resistance regardless of what form you take, and
it allows you to regenerate energy fast enough to abuse breath
attacks.  For example, polymorphing into a black dragon, and blasting
things with your breath attack will make the game easier.

You might want a couple of charging scrolls, to read while confused,
in case you need some emergency energy to make breath attacks.  The
last time I played a Doppleganger, I also carried around a wand to
polymorph to zap myself in an emergency, because the Doppleganger's
#youpoly uses up energy, which I might need right away for breath
attacks.


